From: local customization
Subject: [PATCH] set mDNS hostname to vent1

Upstream hardcodes the hostname in configure_network_identity(). Not exposed
in NVS or the portal, so it can only be changed at build time.

Rebuild after applying:
  export IDF_PATH=~/esp/esp-idf
  ./tools/idf-build.sh firmware esp32 build
  # firmware/build/dragonvent.bin is the ota.bin

--- a/firmware/main/app_main.c
+++ b/firmware/main/app_main.c
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@ static const char *TAG = "dragonvent";
 static esp_err_t configure_network_identity(void)
 {
     const dc_wifi_identity_t identity = {
-        .hostname = "dragonvent",
+        .hostname = "vent1",
         .instance_name = "DragonVent",
         .ap_ssid_prefix = "DragonVent_",
         .ap_password = DC_WIFI_DEFAULT_AP_PASSWORD,
